        />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>可答题指标零下降：recall 与事实命中不因“更爱拒答”而变差；困难集（口语/简称）recall 由 80% 提到 100%</Text>
